Description: SecuBox SOC — Security Operations Center aggregator
 Aggregates alerts, threat-map data, and P2P intel from Hub and WAF
 into a single Security Operations Center dashboard.
 Read-only consumer of the existing alert sources.
 .
 Distinct from sibling packages in the SOC cluster:
  - secubox-soc-agent — edge node agent reporting up to a gateway.
  - secubox-soc-gateway — central fleet-monitoring hub
    (multi-board aggregator).
  - la page Vigie SOC (www/soc/), trois ecrans lus sur les sources vivantes.
